\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2.1}{\ignorespaces The two nested time scales in ArchesWeather. Each autoregressive weather step \(n\rightarrow n+1\) contains a complete flow of \(T=25\) steps used to generate the forecast residual. \relax }}{15}{figure.caption.5}%
